$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475370152_668348325619297478_755052765483522218", {"feature":"668348325619297478","feature2":"755052765483522218","owner":"103582791475370152","commentthreadid":"620408999","total_count":46,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":40421666,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":4072240,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"755052765483522938":{"text":"your tears are delicious. keep em coming \ud83d\ude01\nfeminism is over.","author":"Patient Zero"},"755052765483523031":{"text":"[quote=Patient Zero;755052765483522938]your tears are delicious. keep em coming \ud83d\ude01\nfeminism is over. [\/quote]\nFemi what?","author":"Sylvane"},"755052765483524334":{"text":"I feel like no one understands what this game actually is. Lol. This IS feminism. It's a woman trapped in a shit marriage working to save money to escape her husband.","author":"HiMyNameIsBalls"},"755052765483525927":{"text":"[quote=HiMyNameIsBalls;755052765483524334]I feel like no one understands what this game actually is. Lol. This IS feminism. It's a woman trapped in a shit marriage working to save money to escape her husband. [\/quote]\n\ndev is clearly taking the piss. and so am i lmfao","author":"Patient Zero"},"755052765483528165":{"text":"Shut up and go do your chore.","author":"Super Weaner"},"755052765483538618":{"text":"[quote=Mana]Ah yes, how I love when sad Men incorporate their incel agendas into gaming.\nThe AI song in the trailer is cherry on top.\nAnd the best part? Housewife simulator could have worked if it weren't pumped with incel \u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665 and some actual work were put into it. [\/quote]\n \nNice try you clown first you bash highguard and now you are here yeah nice bait you clown","author":"dark-lord21"},"755052765483596719":{"text":"[quote=lafrance97;755052765483555780]this game is bad and im a man imagine steam should remove that crap it very bad and disrepesct woman i feel bad for my gf [\/quote]\nI hope she see this post bro.","author":"Super Weaner"},"755052765483608470":{"text":"What, you don't like games about women? You hate women or something?","author":"Roger, roger"},"755052765483626243":{"text":"just go and play a woke game and leave us alone u feminist","author":"s1"},"755053102163344242":{"text":"[quote=lafrance97;755052765483555780]this game is bad and im a man imagine steam should remove that crap it very bad and disrepesct woman i feel bad for my gf [\/quote]\nI feel bad for your first grade English teacher.","author":"Chib"},"755053102163409362":{"text":"A game dev felt passionately enough to create a game. Regardless of if I agree with their message, even if it was \"AI Slop\" it's still more than I (and probably most commentors) have done?\nMore power to them, even more if they make money off of this, even more if they create a game that I personally enjoy.\n:> add two filters the \"legit\" path and the \"sarcasm\" path with the only difference being the soundtrack?","author":"somelameguy"},"802341528343281999":{"text":"[quote=Mana]Ah yes, how I love when sad Men incorporate their incel agendas into gaming.\nThe AI song in the trailer is cherry on top.\nAnd the best part? Housewife simulator could have worked if it weren't pumped with incel \u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665\u2665 and some actual work were put into it. [\/quote]\n\nGuarentee no one is holding you at gunpoint to buy it lol. Learn to deal and move on","author":"Riven"},"798964766335981235":{"text":"Bem, se o jogo for sobre uma mulher oprimida que percebe isso e manda o marido se f****... tudo bem. N\u00e3o porque eu pense que uma mulher que faz tarefas dom\u00e9sticas \u00e9 algo ruim - todos n\u00f3s devemos fazer e eu espero que todo mundo par aqui saiba ou aprenda a lavar um vaso sanit\u00e1rio e fazer comida. Mas a ideia de ser oprimido s\u00f3 \u00e9 boa para o opressor, n\u00e3o \u00e9, rapazes (que secretamente tamb\u00e9m gostam de umas 'brincadeiras')?","author":"robsonfz"},"839501596191706418":{"text":"Grow up.","author":"Marty"},"839501596191716684":{"text":"[quote=Marty;839501596191706418]Grow up. [\/quote]\nbold of you to speak up incel","author":"Sylvane"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
