			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_755053102163409362">
				A game dev felt passionately enough to create a game. Regardless of if I agree with their message, even if it was &quot;AI Slop&quot; it's still more than I (and probably most commentors) have done?<br>More power to them, even more if they make money off of this, even more if they create a game that I personally enjoy.<br>:&gt; add two filters the &quot;legit&quot; path and the &quot;sarcasm&quot; path with the only difference being the soundtrack?			</div>
